  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:XAtr">X Atr</ref> 1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ðæt is þonne ærest, þæt we ealle fram synnan georne gecyrran ⁊ ure misdæda geornlice betan ⁊ ænne God æfre lufian ⁊ weorðian ⁊ ænne Christendom georne healdan ⁊ ælcne hæðendom mid ealle aweorpan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">The first provision is, that all of us zealously turn from sins and zealously make amends for our misdeeds, and love and honour for all time one God, and zealously uphold one Christian faith, and utterly remounce all heathen practices.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
